	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Half of a cut Amphenol DDR504112805K 288-pin DDR5 DIMM socket (vertical SMT, 0.85 mm pitch). Contacts 1-69 (front) and 145-213 (back) numbered; positions 70-75 / 214-219 of the 75-position half are unnumbered pads (soldered for strength, unconnected). End-tower hold-down only; the key-side post is clipped off. Pad geometry from the Amphenol DDR504112805K datasheet footprint.")
